  "metadata": {
    "id": "twin_spires",
    "name": "Twin Spires",
    "author": "ChronoSplit",
    "description": "Two spires at either end of a narrow causeway hanging in open space. Each team spawns in its own spire, climbs the switchback stairwells past the windows to a railed sniper deck, and fights for the railgun on the central bridge and the rockets beneath it. No walls and no railings on the causeway: one step too far and the void takes you. An homage in spirit to the classic tower-to-tower sniping duel above a planet.",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
    "parentId": null,
    "recommendedPlayers": {
